567			<section aria-label="Introduction">
568				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
569				<p>
570					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
571					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
572				</p>
573				<p>
574					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
575					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
576				</p>
