581				<ul>
582					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
583					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
584					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
585					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
586					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
587					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
588				</ul>
