599				<article class="card">
600					<h3>Interactive Elements</h3>
601					<p>Buttons and links are fully accessible with clear focus states. All interactive elements include visible focus indicators and proper ARIA labels.</p>
602					<p><strong>Keyboard navigation:</strong> Use <kbd>Tab</kbd> to move forward, <kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Tab</kbd> to move backward, and <kbd>Enter</kbd> or <kbd>Space</kbd> to activate.</p>
603				</article>
